=== BATCH SCREENING TASK ===
Review: Surgical methods for first trimester termination of pregnancy
Total studies to screen: 10

SELECTION CRITERIA:
Randomised controlled trials comparing different surgical methods for first trimester abortion were eligible.

INSTRUCTIONS: For each study below, decide INCLUDE or EXCLUDE.
